        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Ground of deep salmon-colored figured taffeta. Brocaded in plychrome silks, tinsel, gilded tinsel, silk frisé yarn, silver frisé yarn, and gilded silver frisé yarn. Undulating lacy ribbons with floral sprays, small sailing ships and flags. In the interspaces, vases with flowers. Soiled, very faded. Several small scraps of natrural-colored linen canvas attached to the back."@en ;
